eople's scripts.[K[41d[K[42d(B[0;1m[33m### Pattern[43d[39m(B[m[K[44d(B[0;1m[36m`grep`[39m(B[m takes a (B[0;1m[32m**regular expression**[39m(B[m — a small language for describing sets of[45dstrings, not a literal string. (B[0;1m[36m`foobar`[39m(B[m is a valid regex that happens to match[K[46donly the literal text (B[0;1m[36m`foobar`[39m(B[m; (B[0;1m[36m`fo*bar`[39m(B[m and (B[0;1m[36m`^foo`[39m(B[m match many things. Covered[K[47dproperly in lecture 4 (Data Wrangling). (B[0;1m[36m`man grep`[39m(B[m, section **REGULAR[48dEXPRESSIONS**.[49d[K[26d[?12l[?25h[?25l[?12l[?25h[28d[?25l[?12l[?25h[32d[?25l[?12l[?25h[35d[?25l[?12l[?25h[37d[?25l[?12l[?25h[42d[?25l[?12l[?25h[44d[?25l[2;50r[50;1H[24S[1;52r[26;1H(B[0;1m[33m---[28d## Reference — bash syntax[30d[39m(B[mWritten up because the syntax felt needlessly complicated compared to Python and[31dC++, where the space next to (B[0;1m[36m`=`[39m(B[m doesn't matter and variables don't need sigils.[32dIt isn't arbitrary. It all follows from one design decision.[34d(B[0;1m[33m### The one idea[36d[32m**Bash is a text-substitution language, not an expression language.**[38d[39m(B[mPython and C++ parse expressions. (B[0;1m[36m`x = 5`[39m(B[m — the parser knows (B[0;1m[36m`x`[39m(B[m is a name and (B[0;1m[36m`5`[39d[39m(B[ma value, because the grammar says so.[41dBash has no expressions. Its entire job is to build command lines. Every line is:[42dsplit into words, expand the words, then treat word one as a command and the rest[43das its arguments. Everything is a string, because everything ends up as an[44dargument to a program.[46dEvery oddity below follows from that.[48d(B[0;1m[33m### Why `=` must be glued[26d[39m(B[m[?12l[?25h[?25l[?12l[?25h[28d[?25l[?12l[?25h[30d[?25l[?12l[?25h[34d[?25l[?12l[?25h[36d[?25l[?12l[?25h[38d[?25l[?12l[?25h[4